  m_text: '<size=54><color=#E6B76A>MICHAEL MANOR</color></size>

    <size=31><color=#D7C8B6>VR
    CONTROLS</color></size>


    <size=24>Grip  -  pick up and hold a ritual artifact

    Release
    inside a glowing ring  -  insert the artifact

    Blue lock light  -  current
    ritual destination

    Red lock flash  -  wrong artifact or wrong order

    Right
    Trigger  -  launch orbiting relic

    Left Primary  -  change hall light

    Right
    Secondary  -  outside view / return

    Right Primary  -  quit</size>'
